txt := txt + [' - can we use strings.. '].
txt := txt + ['without leaking '] + x + ['s of bytes ?'].
txt dołącz: ['!!'].
Wyjście pisz: txt.
} uruchom.

Program posprzątaj.

usedMemory1 := (Program pamięć ? 0).


